      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I didn't hear about the new keyboard, hopefully that helps things, but for now I'll just add:\n\nthe current keyboard for the chatbox is *really* awful, it feels like it takes forever to input things, like there's a massive delay between how often you can input letters so it often takes me like a solid 30 seconds to enter really simple short responses, i would love for it to be faster but would also love some 'phone' style features, maybe predictive word completions or full on swipe typing would massively help people who want to use the chatbox to communicate",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
