  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-27T10:57:21.353Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey, I always had trouble using vrc's keyboard and I had no idea why until my friend pointed out that the character gets typed whenever you LIFT the trigger instead of press it, which is why it's so hard to use. If you could switch that around the keyboard would be much faster.",
